2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.82</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥22,520〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F184648%2F184648.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f766e; white-space: nowrap;\">7位</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F9045%2F9045.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0f766e; text-decoration: underline;\">信玄の湯　湯村温泉　常磐ホテル</a></td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.78</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥23,100〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F9045%2F9045.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【山梨県の有名なもの完全ガイド】観光名所・ご当地グルメ・定番お土産・地酒ランキング</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">山梨県の誇る雄大な自然美と歴史ある街並み、名湯温泉、絶品ご当地グルメを満喫できる人気観光ハブ。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">🌟 山梨県のハイライト＆名物グルメ</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">📌 主要な観光ハイライト</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">富士五湖・河口湖・石和温泉名所・山梨県名物・絶景温泉</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍴 代表的なご当地グルメ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">山梨県甲州牛・ほうとう・甲州ワインビーフ・信玄餅スイーツ</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏯 山梨県で絶対に訪れるべき有名な観光名所</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">1</span>\n            富士山（吉田ルート/五合目）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本の最高峰であり世界文化遺産の象徴。富士スバルラインで行く五合目は観光施設が充実し、眼下に雲海を望む圧巻のスタート地点です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">2</span>\n            新倉山浅間公園（忠霊塔）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">五重塔（忠霊塔）越しに雄大な富士山と満開の桜を一望できる、世界中の観光客が熱望する「これぞ日本」という究極のアジアンビジュアルスポット。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">3</span>\n            富士五湖（河口湖）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">富士山の北麓に位置する静かな湖畔リゾート。四季折々の富士山が水面に映る「逆さ富士」や、大石公園のコキア・ラベンダー越しのアングルが人気です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">4</span>\n            勝沼ぶどうの丘\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本有数のワイン産地・勝沼の高台に立つ総合ワインリゾート。タパスとともに100種類以上の甲州ワインを試飲できる地下ワインカーヴが魅力です。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🎁 山梨県で喜ばれる人気定番お土産（日持ち・個包装）</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 山梨県 伝統銘菓「特製和菓子」</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">伝統銘菓</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">山梨県で長年愛される伝統銘菓。しっとりした上品な甘みと職人技が光る極上手土産。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 山梨県 トレンド高級ラングドシャ</strong>\n            <span class=\"